@page "/aboutus"

<div class="content">
    <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>Blogs is a free blogging website built with the cause of building a community to let people connect and communicate</p>
        </div>
        <img class="about-image" src="./Images//blogging-tips.jpg" alt="AboutUsImage" />
    </div>
    <div class="about-container">
        <img class="about-image" src="./Images/360_F_193224512_jktLglscIiq6MtUSlT3a7xavUvEp5uAe.jpg" alt="BlogsLogo" />
        <div class="about-content">
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>Our mission is to provide a platform for people to share their thoughts, ideas, and experiences with the world. We believe that everyone has a story to tell, and we want to help you tell it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h3>Our Story</h3>
            <p>Blogs was founded in 2025 by a passionate individual who wanted to create a space for people to connect and share their stories. We started as a small team, but we have grown into a community of writers, readers, and creators who are dedicated to making the world a better place through storytelling.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="about-image" src="./Images/story.png" alt="OurStoryImage" />
    </div>
    
</div>


